{"meta":{"id":"script-link","category":"it/syntax/javascript/files","title":"script · css 연결 · JS","subtitle":"(JAVASCRIPT)","summary":"<script src>, <link rel=stylesheet>, defer · type=module, 인라인 스크립트","tags":["javascript","f-import","html"],"color":"teal","watermarkClass":"watermark-bg-blog-teal","source":"언어별사용 정리.xlsx","updatedAt":"2026-10-12"},"html":"<div class=\"absolute -top-12 -right-12 w-48 h-48 bg-teal-200/40 rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-70 pointer-events-none\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"relative pb-5 border-b border-teal-200/70\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2.5\">\r\n<span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-teal-50 text-teal-700 border border-teal-300/60 tracking-wider\"><span class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></span>JAVASCRIPT</span>\r\n</div>\r\n<h1 class=\"text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-tight leading-snug\">script · css 연결 · JS</h1>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 flex items-start gap-2 bg-teal-50/70 border border-teal-200/60 rounded-xl p-3\"><svg class=\"w-4 h-4 text-teal-600 shrink-0 mt-0.5\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 20 20\"><path fill-rule=\"evenodd\" d=\"M10 18a8 8 0 100-16 8 8 0 000 16zm3.707-9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414-1.414L9 10.586 7.707 9.293a1 1 0 00-1.414 1.414l2 2a1 1 0 001.414 0l4-4z\" clip-rule=\"evenodd\"></path></svg><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-700 leading-relaxed font-medium\"><strong class=\"text-stone-900\">요약:</strong> &lt;script src&gt;, &lt;link rel=stylesheet&gt;, defer · type=module, 인라인 스크립트</p></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"py-5 border-t border-stone-100\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><div class=\"w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-teal-500\"></div><h2 class=\"text-sm font-bold text-stone-900 tracking-wide\">HTML 에서 js · css 연결</h2></div><div class=\"my-3 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-stone-800/80 bg-[#1e1f26] shadow-sm\"><div class=\"px-3 py-1.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-stone-400 bg-[#26272f] border-b border-white/5\">html</div><pre class=\"px-3.5 py-3 text-[11px] sm:text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-stone-100 font-mono overflow-x-auto whitespace-pre\">&lt;head&gt;\r\n  &lt;link rel=&quot;stylesheet&quot; href=&quot;css/style.css&quot;&gt;\r\n  &lt;script src=&quot;js/app.js&quot; defer&gt;&lt;/script&gt;      &lt;!-- defer: HTML 을 다 읽은 뒤 실행 --&gt;\r\n  &lt;script type=&quot;module&quot; src=&quot;js/main.js&quot;&gt;&lt;/script&gt;\r\n&lt;/head&gt;\r\n&lt;body&gt;\r\n  &lt;script&gt;\r\n    &#x27;use strict&#x27;;\r\n    function fCheck() { /* 페이지 안에 직접 작성 */ }\r\n  &lt;/script&gt;\r\n&lt;/body&gt;</pre></div><div class=\"space-y-1.5 text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 pl-1\"><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\"><code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>&lt;script&gt;</code> 를 head 에 그냥 두면 아래 HTML 이 아직 없어 요소를 못 찾는다 — <code class='font-mono text-[12px] text-stone-800 bg-stone-100 rounded px-1'>defer</code> 또는 body 끝에 둔다</span></div><div class=\"tip-bullet-row\"><span class=\"tip-bullet-dot text-teal-600\">•</span><span class=\"tip-bullet-content\">jQuery 를 쓰면 $(function(){ … }) 안에서 실행 (jQuery › 기본 연결)</span></div></div><p class=\"text-xs sm:text-sm text-stone-600 leading-relaxed\"><span class='text-stone-500'>관련:</span> CSS › 연결, HTML › 폼 · 링크</p></div>\r\n","path":"it/syntax/javascript/files/script-link","breadcrumb":[{"id":"root","title":"Home","path":""},{"id":"it","title":"IT","path":"it"},{"id":"syntax","title":"프로그램 언어(문법)","path":"it/syntax"},{"id":"javascript","title":"JAVASCRIPT","path":"it/syntax/javascript"},{"id":"files","title":"파일","path":"it/syntax/javascript/files"}],"hasImage":false}